1
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
The Christmas Train is a family, tv movie, drama film directed by Ron Oliver.

2
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Forced to take the intercontinental trip to Los Angeles by train, and determined to chronicle his adventure,
disillusioned journalist Tom Langdon finds himself westbound with a variety of characters.

3
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
While all passengers on the Christmas train appear to be headed for the same destination, Tom has no idea that
the rugged locomotives taking him across America will instead detour straight into his heart.

4
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Tom Langdon, played by Dermot Mulroney.

