01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The Christmas Train is a 2017 American Christmas romantic drama television film directed by Ron Oliver and written
by Neal Dobrofsky and Tippi Dobrofsky, based on the 2003 novel of the same name by David Baldacci.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
The film stars Dermot Mulroney, Kimberly
Williams-Paisley, Danny Glover, and Joan Cusack.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film premiered on Hallmark Hall of Fame, the Hallmark Channel,
and Hallmark Movies & Mysteries on November 25, 2017.

